/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only */
/* ============================================================================================================
   Fluvi design system ("river at night", set like a magazine). The only stylesheet with values: screens keep
   layout (sizes, positions) in their <style> and take every colour, space, radius, type size, duration and
   shadow from the tokens below. Add a token or a shared class here instead of a loose value in a screen.

   Brand. Fluvi (Latin fluvius, river) is the river that carries the console to this screen. The mark is a meander
   that draws a lowercase "f" in one amber stroke; the wordmark is "Fluvi" in Bricolage Grotesque Condensed
   ExtraBold with the dot of the "i" as the lantern (assets/ui/brand/*.svg, drawn with <svg src>). Never brand
   anything as "Xbox": console models are data.

   The signature is the current: a thin luminous line that appears in three places only. It draws the mark on the
   splash, it is the progress line of Connecting, and it is the latency graph (overlay and corner HUD). Everything
   else stays quiet.

   Colour roles. --bed is the deep river (visible teal, never black). Surfaces layer on it: --tile, --tile-hi.
   --brand (the lantern, amber) is the only interactive colour: focus, the main action, selected. --alive means
   alive or good, --danger means failure; --pale and --caution are the two middle health bands (Bom, Instável).
   Text: --foam (primary), --bank (secondary, ~8:1), --silt (tertiary). Over the game: --glass (bed at 80%) with
   backdrop-filter var(--blur-lg).

   Tokens (on body, inherited):
     colour   --brand* --alive* --pale --caution --danger* --bed* --tile* --water* --track* --line* --foam --bank
              --silt --glass* --scrim --paper* --skeleton*  (+ full box-shadow values --shadow-* / --glow-*)
     spacing  --s0..--s10 (2 4 8 12 16 24 32 48 64 96 128 dp), half steps --s1h 6, --s2h 10, --s3h 14;
              --margin 64 (the bank every screen starts from)
     sizes    --bar 40 (title bar), --top 88 (top bar), --btn 60 (button height), --target 56 (smallest focus
              target), --row 76 (settings row), --ctl 280 (settings control column), --panel 620 (overlay)
     radius   --r-hair 2, --r-chip 8, --r-row 14, --r-tile 24, --r-panel 28, --r-pill
     type     1.25 steps from 18: --t-xs 15, --t-sm 18 (body), --t-md 22, --t-lg 28, --t-xl 35, --t-2xl 44,
              --t-3xl 56, --t-hero 88. Nothing is set under 15 dp. Icons: --i-sm 20, --i-md 24, --i-lg 32.
     motion   --d-fast .14s (hover, focus), --d-base .2s, --d-cross .18s (screen crossfade), --d-bed .2s,
              --d-veil-in .25s, --d-veil-out .35s, --d-slow .3s (panels), --d-enter .4s (one arrival per
              screen), --d-fill .5s, --d-draw .7s (the mark), --d-late 1.1s (arrives after the mark),
              --d-breathe 1.2s, --d-loop 1.4s (shimmer, runner)
     blur     --blur-sm, --blur-lg

   Families. "Bricolage Grotesque" (700, 800) for titles; "Bricolage Condensed" (700, 800) for the big things
   people read from the couch (console name, latency, sign-in code, the wordmark); "Atkinson Hyperlegible Next"
   (400, 500, 600) for all interface text and numbers in tables (it never mixes up 0/O or 1/l); "Phosphor" for
   icons (span.icon with the glyph as an entity, e.g. &#xE272;). Sentence case everywhere: no all-caps labels.

   Components
     body.solid             full screen on the river bed (not over the stream)
     .chrome (shell.rml)    title bar: .chrome-brand, .chrome-drag, .chrome-btn (.close); body.inactive dims it
     .frame                 the area under the title bar (the shell's content slot)
     .topbar (+ .actions)   per-screen top bar; .brand-small shows the wordmark when the title bar is hidden
     button                 60 dp; .primary (amber), .ghost (text only), .danger, .wide,
                            .icon-only, .disabled. Icon + text: <button><span class="icon">&#x..;</span><span>[key]</span>
     .icon                  Phosphor glyph (.sm .lg)
     .chip + .avatar        account chip; .menu + .menu-item (dropdown under it)
     .dialog                confirmation over a .scrim (.dialog-actions)
     .toast                 short notice bottom centre (.on shows it)
     .section               collapsible: .section-head (focusable, .open) + .section-body
     .segmented + .seg      choice with a description line under each option (.seg .what, .seg .desc)
     .graph + .bar          the current as N thin bars (data-for), .graph.small for the HUD
     .hints + .hint         key hints bottom left; .keycap.kb (keyboard) and .padkey / .gp (controller) switch with
                            body.pad (set by the UI from the last input)
     .row (settings)        .label (.t, .d, .next) + .control (fixed --ctl column): .stepper (.arrow, .value)
                            or .switch (.on) + .knob; .meter + .fill
     .led (.alive .pale .caution .danger), .live, .runner (a thin line running: indeterminate progress)
     .notice                failure banner
     motion helpers         .arrive (one arrival), body.leaving (crossfade out), body.to-bed (connecting goes
                            to the bed), .veil (.lift / .drop) on the stream, body.calm turns every animation off
     scrollbars             thin thumb; required by every overflow: auto box

   Skeletons (pending data; never a spinner or an empty screen): the real layout with placeholder shapes, shown
   with data-if on a model flag (sign.pending, cons.loading, conn.loading, set.loaded, stream.has_stats):
     .skeleton (any size) / .skeleton-line (.w-20 .w-40 .w-60 .w-80, .tall, .display, .hero, .chip) /
     .skeleton-circle / .skeleton-card (.flat = list row) / .skeleton-block (QR, images)

   Sizes are dp on a 1600x900 canvas; the UI sets dp = DPI scale x clamp(window / canvas, 1, 1.5), and every
   layout is fluid down to 1120x630 dp. Fonts are loaded in code (Rml::LoadFontFace), not here.
   ============================================================================================================ */

/* ---- Element defaults (RmlUi has no user-agent sheet) ---- */
div, p, h1, h2, h3, section, header, footer { display: block; }
span, em, strong { display: inline; }
strong { font-weight: bold; }
img, svg { display: inline-block; }

/* ---- Tokens ---- */
body
{
	/* the lantern */
	--brand:          #FFB547;
	--brand-hi:       #FFC772;
	--brand-deep:     #E8982A;
	--brand-ink:      #2A1800;
	--brand-edge:     #FFF0D4;
	--brand-soft:     #FFB54729;
	--brand-haze:     #FFB54714;
	--brand-half:     #FFB54780;
	--brand-dim:      #FFB54740;
	--brand-clear:    #FFB54700;
	--brand-spark:    #FFE4B5;

	/* state and health bands: Ótimo / Bom / Instável / Ruim */
	--alive:          #6FD3A5;
	--alive-soft:     #6FD3A526;
	--pale:           #B8DDB0;
	--caution:        #FFA98F;
	--danger:         #FF7A6E;
	--danger-soft:    #FF7A6E24;
	--danger-hover:   #FF7A6E3D;
	--danger-dim:     #FF7A6E66;
	--danger-text:    #FFC6BF;

	/* the river */
	--bed:            #0A2228;
	--bed-deep:       #071A1F;
	--bed-veil:       #0A2228CC;
	--bed-frost:      #0A2228F2;
	--bed-clear:      #0A222800;
	--tile:           #10313A;
	--tile-hi:        #174552;
	--tile-line:      #1D5260;
	--reflection:     #2E8C9A1F;
	--reflection-clear: #2E8C9A00;
	--water:          #EEF5F20A;
	--water-hi:       #EEF5F214;
	--water-press:    #EEF5F221;
	--track:          #EEF5F224;
	--track-dim:      #EEF5F214;
	--line:           #9FBDBA24;
	--line-hi:        #9FBDBA4D;
	--glass:          #0A2228CC;
	--glass-line:     #EEF5F21F;
	--scrim:          #04100FB8;
	--paper:          #F3F7F5;
	--paper-ink:      #10313A;
	--skeleton:       #EEF5F20F;
	--skeleton-hi:    #EEF5F224;

	/* text */
	--foam:           #EEF5F2;
	--bank:           #9FBDBA;
	--silt:           #7C9E9B;

	/* elevation and glow (full box-shadow values) */
	--glow-focus:     #FFB5474D 0dp 0dp 22dp 0dp;
	--glow-strong:    #FFB54780 0dp 0dp 30dp 0dp;
	--glow-alive:     #6FD3A5AA 0dp 0dp 12dp 0dp;
	--glow-danger:    #FF7A6E4D 0dp 0dp 22dp 0dp;
	--glow-spark:     #FFB54799 0dp 0dp 14dp 0dp;
	--shadow-tile:    #00000066 0dp 20dp 44dp 0dp, #FFB54733 0dp 0dp 30dp 0dp;
	--shadow-panel:   #00000080 0dp 28dp 64dp 0dp;
	--shadow-menu:    #00000099 0dp 18dp 40dp 0dp;
	--shadow-paper:   #00000080 0dp 26dp 60dp 0dp;

	/* spacing */
	--s0: 2dp;  --s1: 4dp;  --s1h: 6dp; --s2: 8dp;  --s2h: 10dp; --s3: 12dp; --s3h: 14dp; --s4: 16dp;
	--s5: 24dp; --s6: 32dp; --s7: 48dp; --s8: 64dp; --s9: 96dp; --s10: 128dp;
	--margin: 64dp;

	/* sizes */
	--bar: 40dp; --top: 88dp; --btn: 60dp; --target: 56dp; --row: 76dp; --ctl: 280dp; --panel: 620dp;

	/* radius: small things round, surfaces soft, panels softer */
	--r-hair: 2dp; --r-chip: 8dp; --r-row: 14dp; --r-tile: 24dp; --r-panel: 28dp; --r-pill: 999dp;

	/* type (1.25 steps from 18) */
	--t-xs: 15dp; --t-sm: 18dp; --t-md: 22dp; --t-lg: 28dp; --t-xl: 35dp; --t-2xl: 44dp; --t-3xl: 56dp; --t-hero: 88dp;
	--i-sm: 20dp; --i-md: 24dp; --i-lg: 32dp;

	/* motion */
	--d-fast: 0.14s; --d-base: 0.2s; --d-cross: 0.18s; --d-bed: 0.2s; --d-veil-in: 0.25s; --d-veil-out: 0.35s;
	--d-slow: 0.3s; --d-enter: 0.4s; --d-fill: 0.5s; --d-draw: 0.7s; --d-late: 1.1s; --d-breathe: 1.2s; --d-loop: 1.4s;

	/* blur */
	--blur-sm: 12dp; --blur-lg: 32dp;

	font-family: "Atkinson Hyperlegible Next";
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: var(--t-sm);
	line-height: 1.45;
	color: var(--foam);
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0;
	opacity: 1;
	transition: opacity var(--d-cross) cubic-out;
}

/* Full screens on the river bed: deep water, the lantern's light upstream, a cold reflection downstream. */
body.solid
{
	background-color: var(--bed);
	decorator: radial-gradient(circle 1100dp at 0% -10%, var(--brand-haze), var(--brand-clear)),
	           radial-gradient(circle 900dp at 100% 110%, var(--reflection), var(--reflection-clear)),
	           linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bed), var(--bed-deep));
}

/* ---- Title bar (shell.rml): drawn by the UI, hit-tested by the window ---- */
.chrome
{
	position: absolute;
	top: 0dp; left: 0dp; right: 0dp;
	height: var(--bar);
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	color: var(--bank);
	transition: color var(--d-base) cubic-out;
}
body.inactive .chrome { color: var(--silt); }
.chrome-brand { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s2); padding: 0dp var(--s4); }
.chrome-mark { width: 22dp; height: 22dp; }
.chrome-word { width: 46dp; height: 22dp; }
body.inactive .chrome-brand { opacity: 0.6; }
.chrome-drag { flex: 1; height: var(--bar); }
.chrome-btn
{
	width: 52dp;
	height: var(--bar);
	line-height: var(--bar);
	text-align: center;
	font-size: var(--t-sm);
	color: var(--bank);
	/* Mouse only: out of Tab and D-pad order, but focusable, since RmlUi sends a click to the nearest focusable. */
	tab-index: none;
	nav: none;
	focus: auto;
	transition: background-color color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.chrome-btn:hover { background-color: var(--water-hi); color: var(--foam); }
.chrome-btn:active { background-color: var(--water-press); }
.chrome-btn.close:hover { background-color: var(--danger); color: var(--brand-ink); }

/* The shell's content slot: everything under the title bar (the whole window when the bar is hidden). */
.frame { position: absolute; top: var(--bar); left: 0dp; right: 0dp; bottom: 0dp; }
.frame.full { top: 0dp; }

/* ---- Brand in a top bar (only when the title bar, which carries it, is hidden) ---- */
.brand-small { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s3); }
.brand-small .mark { width: 34dp; height: 34dp; }
.brand-small .word { width: 70dp; height: 34dp; }

/* ---- Typography ---- */
h1
{
	font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque";
	font-weight: bold;
	font-size: var(--t-3xl);
	line-height: 1.05;
	letter-spacing: -1dp;
	color: var(--foam);
}
h2 { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque"; font-weight: bold; font-size: var(--t-lg); line-height: 1.15; color: var(--foam); }
h3 { font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--t-md); color: var(--foam); }
.display { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque"; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5dp; line-height: 1.05; }
.condensed { font-family: "Bricolage Condensed"; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0dp; line-height: 1; }
.lead { font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--bank); }
.muted { color: var(--bank); }
.faint { color: var(--silt); }
.small { font-size: var(--t-xs); }
.label-brand { font-weight: 600; color: var(--brand); }
.nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }

.icon
{
	font-family: "Phosphor";
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: var(--i-md);
	line-height: 1;
}
.icon.sm { font-size: var(--i-sm); }
.icon.lg { font-size: var(--i-lg); }

/* ---- Scrollbars: RmlUi needs them sized, or an unstyled bar takes the whole content width. ---- */
scrollbarvertical { width: var(--s1h); margin-left: var(--s2); }
scrollbarhorizontal { height: var(--s1h); margin-top: var(--s2); }
scrollbarvertical slidertrack, scrollbarhorizontal slidertrack { background-color: transparent; }
scrollbarvertical slidertrack, scrollbarvertical sliderbar { width: var(--s1h); }
scrollbarvertical sliderbar { min-height: var(--s7); }
scrollbarhorizontal slidertrack, scrollbarhorizontal sliderbar { height: var(--s1h); }
scrollbarhorizontal sliderbar { min-width: var(--s7); }
scrollbarvertical sliderbar, scrollbarhorizontal sliderbar
{
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	background-color: var(--water-hi);
	transition: background-color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
scrollbarvertical sliderbar:hover, scrollbarvertical sliderbar:active,
scrollbarhorizontal sliderbar:hover, scrollbarhorizontal sliderbar:active { background-color: var(--silt); }
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowdec, scrollbarvertical sliderarrowinc { width: 0dp; height: 0dp; }
scrollbarhorizontal sliderarrowdec, scrollbarhorizontal sliderarrowinc { width: 0dp; height: 0dp; }
scrollbarcorner { width: 0dp; height: 0dp; }

/* ---- Interactive elements: all focusable and D-pad navigable ---- */
button, .tile, .row, .seg, .navitem, .section-head, .menu-item, .toggle
{
	tab-index: auto;
	nav: auto;
	focus: auto;
	cursor: pointer;
}

button
{
	display: inline-flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	gap: var(--s2h);
	box-sizing: border-box;
	height: var(--btn);
	padding: 0dp var(--s5);
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	font-size: var(--t-sm);
	font-weight: 600;
	white-space: nowrap;
	color: var(--foam);
	background-color: var(--water-hi);
	border: 2dp transparent;
	transition: background-color color border-color transform var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
button .icon { font-size: var(--i-md); }
button:hover { background-color: var(--water-press); }
button:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); background-color: var(--water-press); box-shadow: var(--glow-focus); }
button:active { transform: scale(0.97); }

button.primary { color: var(--brand-ink); background-color: var(--brand); padding: 0dp var(--s6); }
button.primary:hover { background-color: var(--brand-hi); }
button.primary:focus-visible { background-color: var(--brand-hi); border-color: var(--brand-edge); box-shadow: var(--glow-strong); }

button.ghost { background-color: transparent; color: var(--bank); padding: 0dp var(--s4); }
button.ghost:hover { color: var(--foam); background-color: var(--water); }
button.ghost:focus-visible { color: var(--foam); background-color: var(--water); }

button.danger { color: var(--danger); background-color: var(--danger-soft); }
button.danger:hover { background-color: var(--danger-hover); }
button.danger:focus-visible { border-color: var(--danger); box-shadow: var(--glow-danger); }

button.wide { min-width: var(--ctl); }
button.icon-only { width: var(--btn); padding: 0dp; }
button.disabled, button.disabled:hover { opacity: 0.45; cursor: arrow; }

/* ---- Top bar shared by the full screens ---- */
.topbar
{
	position: absolute;
	top: 0dp; left: 0dp; right: 0dp;
	height: var(--top);
	padding: 0dp var(--s6) 0dp var(--margin);
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: space-between;
}
.topbar .actions { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s1); }

/* ---- Account chip and its menu ---- */
.chip
{
	display: inline-flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s3);
	box-sizing: border-box;
	height: var(--btn);
	margin: 0dp var(--s2);
	padding: 0dp var(--s4) 0dp var(--s1h);
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	background-color: var(--water);
	font-weight: 600;
	color: var(--foam);
	border: 2dp transparent;
	tab-index: auto;
	nav: auto;
	focus: auto;
	cursor: pointer;
	transition: background-color border-color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.chip:hover, .chip.open { background-color: var(--water-hi); }
.chip:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); box-shadow: var(--glow-focus); }
.chip .icon { font-size: var(--i-sm); color: var(--bank); }
.avatar
{
	width: 44dp; height: 44dp;
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	line-height: 44dp;
	text-align: center;
	font-family: "Bricolage Condensed";
	font-weight: 800;
	font-size: var(--t-md);
	color: var(--brand-ink);
	decorator: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--brand-hi), var(--brand-deep));
}
.menu
{
	position: absolute;
	min-width: 300dp;
	padding: var(--s2);
	border-radius: var(--r-row);
	background-color: var(--tile);
	border: 1dp var(--tile-line);
	box-shadow: var(--shadow-menu);
	animation: var(--d-base) open cubic-out;
}
.menu-item
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s3);
	box-sizing: border-box;
	height: var(--target);
	padding: 0dp var(--s4);
	border-radius: var(--r-chip);
	color: var(--foam);
	border: 2dp transparent;
	transition: background-color border-color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.menu-item .icon { color: var(--bank); }
.menu-item:hover { background-color: var(--water-hi); }
.menu-item:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); background-color: var(--water-hi); }

/* ---- Confirmation dialog ---- */
.scrim
{
	position: absolute;
	top: 0dp; left: 0dp; right: 0dp; bottom: 0dp;
	background-color: var(--scrim);
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	animation: var(--d-base) fade-in cubic-out;
}
.dialog
{
	width: 560dp;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	padding: var(--s6);
	border-radius: var(--r-panel);
	background-color: var(--tile);
	border: 1dp var(--tile-line);
	box-shadow: var(--shadow-panel);
	animation: var(--d-slow) open cubic-out;
}
.dialog h2 { margin-bottom: var(--s3); }
.dialog .lead { font-size: var(--t-sm); }
.dialog-actions { margin-top: var(--s6); display: flex; flex-direction: row; justify-content: flex-end; gap: var(--s3); }

/* ---- Toast: a short notice, bottom centre ---- */
.toast-slot
{
	position: absolute;
	left: 0dp; right: 0dp; bottom: var(--s7);
	display: flex;
	justify-content: center;
	visibility: hidden;
}
.toast-slot.on { visibility: visible; }
.toast
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s3);
	padding: var(--s3) var(--s5);
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	background-color: var(--bed-veil);
	backdrop-filter: blur(var(--blur-sm));
	border: 1dp var(--glass-line);
	box-shadow: var(--shadow-menu);
	font-weight: 600;
	color: var(--foam);
	opacity: 0;
	transform: translateY(12dp);
	transition: opacity transform var(--d-slow) cubic-out;
}
.toast .icon { color: var(--brand); }
.toast-slot.on .toast { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0dp); }

/* ---- Collapsible section ---- */
.section-head
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: space-between;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	min-height: var(--target);
	padding: 0dp var(--s4);
	border-radius: var(--r-row);
	color: var(--bank);
	font-weight: 600;
	border: 2dp transparent;
	transition: background-color border-color color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.section-head .icon { font-size: var(--i-sm); transition: transform var(--d-base) cubic-out; }
.section-head.open .icon { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.section-head:hover { background-color: var(--water); color: var(--foam); }
.section-head:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); background-color: var(--water); color: var(--foam); }
.section-body { padding: var(--s1) var(--s4) var(--s2) var(--s4); animation: var(--d-base) fade-in cubic-out; }

/* ---- Segmented choice with a line under each option ---- */
.segmented { display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: var(--s2); }
.seg
{
	flex: 1;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	min-height: var(--target);
	padding: var(--s3) var(--s4);
	border-radius: var(--r-row);
	background-color: var(--water);
	color: var(--bank);
	border: 2dp transparent;
	transition: background-color color border-color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.seg .what { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s2); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--t-md); color: var(--foam); }
.seg .what .icon { color: var(--bank); }
.seg .desc { margin-top: var(--s1); font-size: var(--t-xs); color: var(--silt); }
.seg:hover { background-color: var(--water-hi); }
.seg:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); box-shadow: var(--glow-focus); }
.seg.on { background-color: var(--brand-soft); border-color: var(--brand-half); }
.seg.on .what .icon { color: var(--brand); }
.seg.on .desc { color: var(--bank); }
.seg.on:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); }
.segmented.compact .seg { min-height: var(--target); padding: 0dp var(--s3); line-height: 52dp; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; }
.segmented.compact .seg.on { color: var(--foam); }

/* ---- The current as a graph: N thin bars, the newest on the right ---- */
.graph
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: flex-end;
	justify-content: space-between;
	height: 64dp;
	border-bottom: 1dp var(--line);
}
.graph .bar { width: 4dp; min-height: 2dp; border-radius: var(--r-hair); background-color: var(--brand-dim); }
.graph .bar.now { background-color: var(--brand); box-shadow: var(--glow-spark); }
.graph.small { height: 30dp; }
.graph.small .bar { width: 3dp; }

/* ---- Key hints: keyboard caps or controller buttons, whichever was used last ---- */
.hints
{
	position: absolute;
	left: var(--margin);
	bottom: var(--s5);
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s5);
	font-size: var(--t-xs);
	color: var(--silt);
}
.hint { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s2); }
.keycap
{
	display: inline-block;
	min-width: 20dp;
	padding: var(--s0) var(--s2) var(--s1) var(--s2);
	border-radius: var(--r-chip);
	border: 1dp var(--line-hi);
	border-bottom-width: 3dp;
	background-color: var(--water);
	font-size: var(--t-xs);
	font-weight: 600;
	text-align: center;
	color: var(--foam);
}
.padkey
{
	display: none;
	width: 28dp; height: 28dp;
	line-height: 28dp;
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	border: 1.5dp var(--line-hi);
	background-color: var(--water);
	font-size: var(--t-xs);
	font-weight: 600;
	text-align: center;
	color: var(--foam);
}
body.pad .padkey { display: inline-block; }
body.pad .keycap.kb { display: none; }
.keycap.gp { display: none; }
body.pad .keycap.gp { display: inline-block; }

/* ---- Settings rows: label left (wraps normally), control in a fixed right column ---- */
.row
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s5);
	box-sizing: border-box;
	min-height: var(--row);
	padding: var(--s3) var(--s4) var(--s3) var(--s5);
	margin-bottom: var(--s1h);
	border-radius: var(--r-row);
	background-color: var(--water);
	border: 2dp transparent;
	nav-left: none;
	nav-right: none;
	transition: background-color border-color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.row:hover { background-color: var(--water-hi); }
.row:focus-visible { border-color: var(--brand); background-color: var(--water-hi); box-shadow: var(--glow-focus); }
.row .label { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0dp; }
.row .label .t { font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--t-sm); color: var(--foam); }
.row .label .d { font-size: var(--t-xs); color: var(--bank); margin-top: var(--s0); }
.row .label .next { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s1h); margin-top: var(--s1h); font-size: var(--t-xs); color: var(--brand); }
.row .label .next .icon { font-size: var(--i-sm); }
.row .control { flex: 0 0 auto; width: var(--ctl); display: flex; flex-direction: row; justify-content: flex-end; }

.stepper { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: var(--ctl); }
.arrow
{
	width: 44dp; height: 44dp;
	line-height: 44dp;
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	text-align: center;
	font-family: "Phosphor";
	font-size: var(--i-sm);
	color: var(--silt);
	cursor: pointer;
	transition: color background-color var(--d-fast) cubic-out;
}
.arrow:hover { color: var(--foam); background-color: var(--water-hi); }
.row:focus-visible .arrow { color: var(--brand); }
.value { flex: 1; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
.value-wrap { flex: 1; }

.switch
{
	width: 56dp; height: 32dp;
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	background-color: var(--track);
	transition: background-color var(--d-base) cubic-out;
}
.switch .knob
{
	margin: var(--s1);
	width: 24dp; height: 24dp;
	border-radius: var(--r-pill);
	background-color: var(--bank);
	transition: transform background-color var(--d-base) cubic-out;
}
.switch.on { background-color: var(--brand); }
.switch.on .knob { transform: translateX(24dp); background-color: var(--brand-ink); }

.meter { margin: var(--s1h) auto 0dp auto; width: 140dp; height: 4dp; border-radius: var(--r-hair); background-color: var(--track-dim); }
.meter .fill { height: 4dp; border-radius: var(--r-hair); background-color: var(--brand); transition: width var(--d-fast) cubic-out; }

/* ---- Notice (failure banner) ---- */
.notice
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s3);
	padding: var(--s3) var(--s4);
	border-radius: var(--r-row);
	background-color: var(--danger-soft);
	color: var(--danger-text);
}
.notice .icon { color: var(--danger); }

/* ---- Status dots ---- */
.led { width: 12dp; height: 12dp; border-radius: var(--r-pill); background-color: var(--silt); }
.led.alive { background-color: var(--alive); box-shadow: var(--glow-alive); }
.led.pale { background-color: var(--pale); }
.led.caution { background-color: var(--caution); }
.led.danger { background-color: var(--danger); }
.live { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: var(--s2); font-weight: 600; color: var(--alive); }
.live .led { background-color: var(--alive); box-shadow: var(--glow-alive); animation: var(--d-breathe) breathe infinite alternate cubic-in-out; }

/* Health words take the colour of their band. */
.band-0 { color: var(--alive); }
.band-1 { color: var(--pale); }
.band-2 { color: var(--caution); }
.band-3 { color: var(--danger); }

/* A thin line running along a track: indeterminate progress (splash, refreshing). It is the current, small. */
.runner { position: relative; height: 2dp; border-radius: var(--r-hair); background-color: var(--track-dim); overflow: hidden; }
.runner .run
{
	position: absolute;
	top: 0dp; left: -30%;
	width: 30%; height: 2dp;
	decorator: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand-clear), var(--brand) 70%, var(--brand-spark));
	animation: var(--d-loop) run infinite cubic-in-out;
}

/* ---- Motion ---- */
@keyframes breathe { from { opacity: 0.35; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes arrive { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16dp); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0dp); } }
@keyframes fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes fade-out { from { opacity: 1; } to { opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes open { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8dp); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0dp); } }
@keyframes run { from { left: -30%; } to { left: 100%; } }

/* Each screen arrives once, as a whole. */
.arrive { animation: var(--d-enter) arrive cubic-out; }

/* Crossfade: the screen that leaves fades out over the one arriving, then the UI hides it. */
body.leaving { opacity: 0; }
/* Entering the game: Connecting sinks into the river bed... */
body.to-bed .frame, body.to-bed .hints { opacity: 0; animation: var(--d-bed) fade-out cubic-out; }
/* ...and the video rises from under a veil of the same colour. Leaving: the veil comes back. */
.veil { position: absolute; top: 0dp; left: 0dp; right: 0dp; bottom: 0dp; background-color: var(--bed); opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; }
.veil.lift { visibility: visible; opacity: 0; animation: var(--d-veil-out) fade-out cubic-out; }
.veil.drop { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; animation: var(--d-veil-in) fade-in cubic-in-out; }

/* Windows "Show animations" off: everything cuts. */
body.calm, body.calm * { animation: none; transition: none; }

/* ---- Skeletons ---- */
@keyframes shimmer
{
	from { decorator: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--skeleton) -40%, var(--skeleton-hi) -20%, var(--skeleton) 0%); }
	to   { decorator: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--skeleton) 100%, var(--skeleton-hi) 120%, var(--skeleton) 140%); }
}
.skeleton, .skeleton-line, .skeleton-circle, .skeleton-card, .skeleton-block
{
	display: block;
	background-color: var(--skeleton);
	border-radius: var(--r-chip);
	animation: var(--d-loop) shimmer infinite linear;
}
.skeleton-line { height: 0.8em; margin: 0.3em 0dp; width: 100%; }
.skeleton-line.tall { height: 1em; }
.skeleton-line.w-20 { width: 20%; }
.skeleton-line.w-40 { width: 40%; }
.skeleton-line.w-60 { width: 60%; }
.skeleton-line.w-80 { width: 80%; }
.skeleton-line.display { height: var(--t-2xl); border-radius: var(--r-row); }
.skeleton-line.hero { height: var(--t-hero); border-radius: var(--r-row); margin: var(--s2) 0dp; }
.skeleton-line.chip { height: var(--btn); width: 220dp; border-radius: var(--r-pill); margin: 0dp; }
.skeleton-circle { border-radius: var(--r-pill); }
.skeleton-card
{
	box-sizing: border-box;
	padding: var(--s5);
	border-radius: var(--r-tile);
	background-color: var(--tile);
	animation: none;   /* the card is the still shape; its lines shimmer */
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	justify-content: space-between;
}
.skeleton-card.flat
{
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--s5);
	min-height: var(--row);
	margin-bottom: var(--s1h);
	padding: var(--s3) var(--s4) var(--s3) var(--s5);
	border-radius: var(--r-row);
	background-color: var(--water);
}
.skeleton-card.flat > div { flex: 1; }
.skeleton-card.flat .skeleton-line.chip { flex: none; width: var(--ctl); height: 40dp; }
.skeleton-block { border-radius: var(--r-panel); }
